    "group": "Burna‑bommer",
    "summary": "As the opponent’s Fight phase ends, choose one visible enemy within 36″ of the Burna-bommer. Exclude MONSTER and VEHICLE units and Lone Operatives. Roll one D6. On a 2+, the chosen unit takes D3 mortal wounds. It also loses access to Hidden until your next turn ends. Ranged attacks against it get [IGNORES COVER] for that same period.",
